sequenceDiagram
  accTitle: Corrected sequence diagram covering Module A and Module B
  accDescr: Shows both exercise families with activation bars and lifeline termination marks. MediaPipe pose estimation runs entirely in the browser for both. Module A makes real backend calls during the session, once per rep boundary or per leg. Module B posts the whole buffered set once at the end.

  actor User
  participant FE as Frontend UI (React)
  participant MP as MediaPipe Pose (in-browser)
  participant BE as Backend API (FastAPI)
  participant LLM as LLM API (Groq, Module B only)
  participant DB as PostgreSQL

  User->>+FE: Select mode + exercise type
  FE->>+BE: POST /api/sessions/start
  BE->>+DB: Insert sessions row (status=in_progress)
  DB-->>-BE: OK
  BE-->>-FE: session_id
  FE-->>-User: Show instructions, then camera setup

  User->>+FE: Grant camera access
  FE->>+MP: Start webcam frames
  loop Every animation frame
    MP-->>FE: Pose landmarks + world landmarks
    FE->>FE: Local capture-quality check, overlay render
  end
  Note over MP,FE: Raw video never leaves the browser.<br/>Only numeric landmarks are held in memory.
  FE-->>-User: Live camera preview ready

  rect rgb(243, 249, 239)
  Note over FE,DB: MODULE A — Sit-to-Stand / SLS / WBLT (rule-based)
  User->>FE: Perform rep / hold (STS, SLS, WBLT)
  FE->>FE: Local rep/hold FSM (UX-only live estimate)
  loop STS: once per detected rep boundary — SLS/WBLT: once per completed leg
    FE->>BE: POST /api/module-a/analyze — or /sls/analyze or /wblt/analyze
    activate BE
    BE->>BE: Deterministic geometry/FSM engine
    alt Set or leg not finished yet
      BE->>FE: Live progress result — NOT persisted
      FE->>User: Update on-screen progress/cue
    else Target reached or last leg
      BE->>+DB: Persist module_a_results — plus embedded warning tags
      DB-->>-BE: OK
      BE->>FE: Final result — persisted true
    end
    deactivate BE
  end
  FE->>+BE: POST /api/sessions/{id}/end
  BE->>+DB: Update sessions row (status=completed)
  DB-->>-BE: OK
  BE-->>-FE: OK
  end

  rect rgb(255, 241, 228)
  Note over FE,DB: MODULE B — Squat (hybrid rule + ML)
  User->>FE: Perform squat reps
  FE->>FE: Local rep FSM plus client-side fault-gate preview — cosmetic only, never sent to backend
  User->>+FE: Tap Finish Set — or auto-finish at rep goal
  FE->>+BE: POST /api/module-b/analyze — ONE call for the whole set
  BE->>BE: Registry dispatch to squat plugin
  BE->>BE: Rep segmentation FSM plus 13-feature extraction per rep
  BE->>BE: Rule sub-scores — ROM / Tempo / Stability
  BE->>BE: Extra Trees model scores every rep — P Good
  BE->>BE: Fusion w_rule=0 w_ml=1 plus fault-gate override → per-rep verdict
  BE->>BE: Majority vote → set band — binary Good / Needs Improvement
  BE->>BE: Compose deterministic feedback template
  opt LLM rewrite enabled
    BE->>+LLM: Structured feedback — band score tags, no raw video or PII
    destroy LLM
    LLM-->>-BE: Rewritten coaching text
    BE->>BE: Safety filter — reject if grade band score or tags changed
  end
  BE->>+DB: Persist module_b_results, module_b_error_tags, feedback_texts
  DB-->>-BE: OK
  BE-->>-FE: Full report response
  FE->>+BE: POST /api/sessions/{id}/end
  BE->>+DB: Update sessions row (status=completed)
  DB-->>-BE: OK
  BE-->>-FE: OK
  FE-->>-User: Set complete, navigating to report
  end

  User->>+FE: Open report
  FE->>+BE: GET /api/module-a/... or /api/module-b/results/{id}
  BE->>+DB: Read stored snapshot (never recomputed)
  destroy DB
  DB-->>-BE: Report data
  BE-->>-FE: Report data
  destroy MP
  MP-->>-FE: Camera stream stopped
  FE-->>-User: Display report + update Dashboard/Progress
